        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "You are invited to RSVP for an information session on the 2026-2027 Community Presenters Assistance and Into the Act programs. Both programs will be launched in early April. Join BC Live’s Program Manager to learn about program updates and resources, review the new online application forms and sample applications, and ask questions. The session will be recorded, and recordings [&hellip;]"
